# SecondaryBar — the Rolltop Bar (副栏) and its pane.
"After 10 seconds" = "10 秒后"
"After 30 seconds" = "30 秒后"
"After 5 seconds" = "5 秒后"
# Picker for always-hidden items in the Rolltop Bar: Always / Behind a disclosure / Never.
"Always" = "始终显示"
"Behind a disclosure" = "折叠显示"
"Close when idle" = "闲置时关闭"
"Hidden items appear in a bar below the menu bar instead of in the menu bar itself, so nothing moves. Option-clicking Rolltop’s icon still shows all items in the menu bar." = "隐藏项会显示在菜单栏下方的栏中，而不是菜单栏本身，因此其他项不会移动。按住 Option 键点按 Rolltop 图标，仍会在菜单栏中显示所有项。"
# VoiceOver label of the disclosure button.
"Hide always-hidden items" = "隐藏始终隐藏的项"
"Hold Option while opening the Rolltop Bar to include them once." = "打开 Rolltop 栏时按住 Option 键，可临时包括这些项。"
"Item size" = "项大小"
"Large" = "大"
"Never" = "永不"
"No hidden items" = "没有隐藏项"
"Opened by hovering, the Rolltop Bar closes when the pointer leaves it and the menu bar." = "通过悬停打开时，指针离开 Rolltop 栏和菜单栏后它就会关闭。"
"Same as the menu bar" = "与菜单栏相同"
"Show always-hidden items" = "显示始终隐藏的项"
"Show hidden items in the Rolltop Bar" = "在 Rolltop 栏中显示隐藏项"
"Small" = "小"
"Rolltop Bar" = "Rolltop 栏"
"secondary bar, panel, hidden items, below the menu bar, size, idle" = "Rolltop 栏, 副栏, 面板, 隐藏项, 菜单栏下方, 大小, 闲置"
# Rolltop Bar style presets (round 2).
"Accent color" = "强调色"
"Adaptive" = "自适应"
"Adaptive follows what is behind the bar. Frosted is more opaque, for legibility." = "“自适应”会跟随栏后方的内容变化。“磨砂”更不透明，更易辨认。"
"Dark" = "深色"
"Frosted" = "磨砂"
"Light" = "浅色"
"On other displays, hidden items appear in the menu bar." = "在其他显示器上，隐藏项会显示在菜单栏中。"
"Style" = "样式"
"The first time hidden items don’t fit on a display, they appear in the menu bar for a moment before moving to the Rolltop Bar." = "隐藏项首次在某台显示器上放不下时，会先在菜单栏中短暂显示，然后移到 Rolltop 栏中。"
"The menu bar is full when macOS shows its » button for items that don’t fit. Hidden items then open in the Rolltop Bar, even where it is otherwise off." ="当 macOS 为放不下的项显示 » 按钮时，菜单栏即为已满。此时隐藏项会在 Rolltop 栏中打开，即使 Rolltop 栏在其他情况下处于关闭状态。"
"Use the Rolltop Bar only on displays with a notch" = "仅在有刘海的显示器上使用 Rolltop 栏"
"Use the Rolltop Bar when the menu bar is full" = "菜单栏已满时使用 Rolltop 栏"
